{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-vs-tactical-allocation","title":"战略配置与战术配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing/strategic-vs-tactical-allocation","wordCount":2502,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"战略配置与战术配置\">战略配置与战术配置</h1><p>一个养老金组合把 60% 放进股票、40% 放进债券，写进投资政策声明（IPS），五年不动——这是战略层。同一支团队在 2026 年初判断美股科技盈利强劲、于是把股票权重临时上调 3 个百分点、用国债对冲——这是战术层。两者用的是同一个组合、同一笔钱，却服务于完全不同的时间尺度与决策逻辑。把它们混为一谈，是配置实务里最常见的错误：要么用战术的频率去折腾本该稳定的战略锚，要么用战略的惰性放过了真实可捕捉的短期错价。本文厘清这两层的边界、各自的下注规模逻辑，以及它们在 2026 年市场里如何协同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>战略配置（Strategic Asset Allocation, SAA）回答的是&quot;长期该持有什么&quot;。它由长期资本市场假设（CMA）、负债结构和风险承受度共同决定，时间尺度是 3 到 5 年甚至更长。SAA 不应频繁改动——道富（State Street）把它描述为&quot;为持久而建，不为脆弱而建&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.ssga.com/us/en/intermediary/insights/strategic-vs-tactical-asset-allocation-what-to-know\">SSGA: Strategic vs Tactical</a>）。</p>\n<p>战术配置（Tactical Asset Allocation, TAA）回答的是&quot;未来几个月相对该超配/低配什么&quot;。它是一种主动策略，基于短期市场状态与宏观预测，对股票、固收、货币的相对权重做偏离，目标是在比 SAA 短得多的窗口里捕捉超额收益（<a href=\"https://www.ssga.com/us/en/intermediary/insights/strategic-vs-tactical-asset-allocation-what-to-know\">SSGA</a>）。</p>\n<p>二者关系最常用核心-卫星（core-satellite）结构表达：核心是战略基准提供稳定性，卫星是战术偏离试图增强收益或管理风险。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[投资政策声明 IPS&lt;br/&gt;负债 + 风险承受度] --&gt; B[战略配置 SAA&lt;br/&gt;长期基准权重]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否产生战术信号?&lt;br/&gt;估值/动量/宏观}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[按基准持有&lt;br/&gt;定期再平衡]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[战术偏离 TAA&lt;br/&gt;在风险预算内倾斜]&#10;  E --&gt; F[下注规模&lt;br/&gt;Kelly / 波动率目标]&#10;  F --&gt; G[实际组合权重]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[业绩归因&lt;br/&gt;分离 SAA 与 TAA 贡献]&#10;  H --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[投资政策声明 IPS&lt;br/&gt;负债 + 风险承受度] --&gt; B[战略配置 SAA&lt;br/&gt;长期基准权重]\n  B --&gt; C{是否产生战术信号?&lt;br/&gt;估值/动量/宏观}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[按基准持有&lt;br/&gt;定期再平衡]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[战术偏离 TAA&lt;br/&gt;在风险预算内倾斜]\n  E --&gt; F[下注规模&lt;br/&gt;Kelly / 波动率目标]\n  F --&gt; G[实际组合权重]\n  D --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[业绩归因&lt;br/&gt;分离 SAA 与 TAA 贡献]\n  H --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>战略配置 SAA</th>\n<th>战术配置 TAA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间尺度</td>\n<td>3-5 年以上</td>\n<td>数周至数月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策依据</td>\n<td>长期 CMA、负债、风险承受度</td>\n<td>估值、动量、宏观周期、情绪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改动频率</td>\n<td>仅定期再平衡（每年 1-2 次）</td>\n<td>主动、持续监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏差形式</td>\n<td>设定基准权重本身</td>\n<td>相对基准的超配/低配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险预算</td>\n<td>整体波动率/回撤目标</td>\n<td>偏离基准的跟踪误差预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业绩归因</td>\n<td>贝塔（市场敞口）</td>\n<td>阿尔法（择时与选股）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>基准本身错配负债</td>\n<td>频繁交易侵蚀收益、追涨杀跌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"战略锚由资本市场假设决定\">战略锚由资本市场假设决定</h2><p>SAA 的权重不是拍脑袋，而是从一组前瞻 10-15 年的资本市场假设里优化出来的。2026 年这些数字本身就在压缩：摩根资管 2026 年长期资本市场假设给出美元 60/40 股债组合未来 10-15 年年化预期回报 6.4%；若把其中 30% 换成多元另类资产，预期回报升到 6.9%、夏普比率较纯 60/40 提升约 25%（<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/about-us/media/press-releases/jp-morgan-releases-2026-long-term-capital-market-assumptions/\">J.P. Morgan 2026 LTCMA</a>）。AQR 的口径更保守：全球 60/40 组合的预期实际回报仅 3.4%，虽比 2021 年历史低点高约 1.5 个百分点，仍远低于 1900 年以来美国近 5% 的长期均值（<a href=\"https://www.aqr.com/Insights/Research/Alternative-Thinking/2026-Capital-Market-Assumptions-for-Major-Asset-Classes\">AQR 2026 CMA</a>）。</p>\n<p>这意味着两点对 SAA 设计的直接影响。其一，当无风险与风险溢价都被压缩时，单靠传统股债已难以达成负债端的回报要求，CMA 越来越把另类资产纳入战略基准本身，而非留给战术层。其二，预期回报是均值，估计误差极大——这正是为什么 SAA 优化要做稳健化处理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>w</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w^* = \\arg\\max_{w} \\left( w^\\top \\mu - \\frac{\\lambda}{2} w^\\top \\Sigma w \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 CMA 给出的预期回报向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是协方差矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险厌恶系数。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计噪声会被均值-方差优化放大成极端权重，实务上会叠加 Black-Litterman 收缩、约束权重区间或直接用风险平价替代，把战略锚做&quot;钝&quot;，让它不因一年的 CMA 更新而剧烈漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"战术信号决定何时偏离\">战术信号决定何时偏离</h2><p>TAA 的核心是承认市场会出现可识别的短期错价。2026 年初的真实定位提供了样本：贝莱德投资研究院进入 2026 年时整体偏好&quot;有选择地承担风险&quot;，超配美股（理由是中东冲突对全球增长的实际冲击可控、科技盈利预期强），同时超配新兴市场股票但保持精选；固收上做多美国国债与韩国国债、做空英国 Gilts 及澳加国债，但低配长久期美债（<a href=\"https://www.blackrock.com/institutions/en-us/insights/2026-macro-outlook\">BlackRock 2026 Macro Outlook</a>）。这些都是相对基准的倾斜，不是推翻基准。</p>\n<p>战术信号通常分三类：估值（资产相对历史/相互之间贵贱）、动量与趋势、宏观周期与政策（如美联储路径）。一个可执行的规则示例是用市场恐慌指标做闸门——当 VIX 突破 25 时削减整体股票敞口，因为上升的 VIX 意味着恐慌，缩减权益有助于在情绪企稳前保护资本（<a href=\"https://www.alphaexcapital.com/stocks/stock-portfolio-management/asset-allocation-with-stocks/tactical-asset-allocation-with-stocks\">AlphaEx Capital: TAA with Stocks</a>）。</p>\n<p>关键纪律是：TAA 的&quot;动&quot;必须被跟踪误差预算约束。一个常用度量是战术组合相对战略基准的跟踪误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TE = \\sqrt{ (w_{TAA} - w_{SAA})^\\top \\Sigma (w_{TAA} - w_{SAA}) }</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.5436em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2964em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">AA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">AA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">AA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">AA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2564em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5436em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>机构通常给 TAA 一个明确的跟踪误差上限（例如年化 1.5%-3%），超过就说明战术偏离过大、已经在事实上重写了战略锚——这是越界信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下注规模-从信号到权重\">下注规模：从信号到权重</h2><p>有了方向信号还不够，必须决定下多大注。这是&quot;配置策略与下注规模&quot;这一章的落点：方向是阿尔法的来源，规模是把阿尔法转成实际收益还是把它交易掉的关键。</p>\n<p>最经典的下注规模公式是 Kelly 准则，给出使长期对数财富增长最大化的资金比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^* = \\frac{bp - q}{b} = p - \\frac{q}{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是投入资金比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是每单位风险的净盈利赔率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是胜率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = 1-p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是败率。但纯 Kelly 往往导致激进仓位和巨大波动，因此实务普遍缩水使用——&quot;半 Kelly&quot;（只用计算值的 50%）是最常见做法，以换取更平滑的回撤路径（<a href=\"https://accountinginsights.org/how-to-use-the-kelly-criterion-for-trading-and-asset-allocation/\">Accounting Insights: Kelly for Allocation</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二种主流方法是波动率目标（volatility targeting）：设定一个固定的年化波动率目标，策略在市场波动时自动减仓、平静时加仓，从而稳定收益的风险特征：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t = w_{base} \\cdot \\frac{\\sigma_{target}}{\\sigma_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前估计的资产波动率。一种把 Kelly 与波动率结合的动态扩展，通过 VIX 排名把波动率信息注入投入比例，针对路径波动动态调整（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2508.16598v1\">arXiv: Sizing the Risk</a>）。</p>\n<p>第三种是风险预算（risk budgeting），一个防止过度杠杆的实用方案是把任何单一头寸的总配置上限设为组合的某个百分比，确保单笔下注不会对组合产生不成比例的冲击（<a href=\"https://accountinginsights.org/how-to-use-the-kelly-criterion-for-trading-and-asset-allocation/\">Accounting Insights</a>）。三种方法常叠加使用：Kelly 给方向性强度、波动率目标做动态缩放、风险预算设硬上限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>下注逻辑</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kelly / 半 Kelly</td>\n<td>按胜率与赔率最大化对数财富</td>\n<td>信号胜率可估、可重复下注</td>\n<td>参数估计错→过度下注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动率目标</td>\n<td>仓位反比于当前波动率</td>\n<td>趋势/择时策略、稳定风险敞口</td>\n<td>高波动期被迫低位减仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险预算</td>\n<td>单头寸/单因子风险占比设上限</td>\n<td>多策略组合、防尾部集中</td>\n<td>上限设错→错失大机会</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协同-核心-卫星与归因闭环\">协同：核心-卫星与归因闭环</h2><p>战略与战术不是二选一，而是分层叠加。许多机构与高净值投资者用核心-卫星结构：核心采用战略配置提供稳定性，卫星头寸做战术倾斜以增强收益或管理风险（<a href=\"https://www.ssga.com/us/en/intermediary/insights/strategic-vs-tactical-asset-allocation-what-to-know\">SSGA</a>）。这套结构能跑通的前提是两条纪律。</p>\n<p>第一条是再平衡纪律。SAA 虽是长期的，但市场漂移会让实际权重偏离基准，因此定期再平衡（通常每年 1-2 次）是维持既定结构的必需动作，而不是战术行为——必须把&quot;恢复基准&quot;的机械再平衡和&quot;主动偏离基准&quot;的战术下注在流程上区分开，否则二者会互相污染。</p>\n<p>第二条是归因闭环。组合的实际收益必须能拆成两块：SAA 贡献（持有基准敞口的贝塔）与 TAA 贡献（偏离基准带来的阿尔法）。只有把两者分开度量，团队才知道战术下注究竟在创造价值还是在消耗成本。2026 年的环境让这件事更紧迫：贝莱德预期 2026 年呈现高于趋势的增长、政策宽松、生产率加速，这种背景有利于有选择的风险承担，但也意味着市场内部分化大、TAA 的对错会被放大（<a href=\"https://www.blackrock.com/institutions/en-us/insights/2026-macro-outlook\">BlackRock 2026 Macro Outlook</a>）。没有归因，团队会把贝塔的运气误记成战术的本事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>战略配置（SAA）是长期锚，由资本市场假设、负债与风险承受度决定，3-5 年尺度，只做机械再平衡；战术配置（TAA）是短期相对偏离，由估值/动量/宏观信号驱动，须受跟踪误差预算约束。</li>\n<li>2026 年的 CMA 数字偏低（摩根 60/40 预期 6.4%、AQR 实际 3.4%），逼迫 SAA 把另类资产纳入战略基准本身，并用稳健化优化避免对噪声过度反应。</li>\n<li>TAA 的方向只是阿尔法来源，下注规模才决定成败：Kelly/半 Kelly 定强度、波动率目标做动态缩放、风险预算设硬上限，三者常叠加。</li>\n<li>核心-卫星结构让两层共存，但必须靠再平衡纪律（区分机械恢复与主动下注）和归因闭环（分离贝塔与阿尔法）守住边界，否则战术会污染战略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"战略配置与战术配置","id":"战略配置与战术配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"战略锚由资本市场假设决定","id":"战略锚由资本市场假设决定"},{"level":2,"text":"战术信号决定何时偏离","id":"战术信号决定何时偏离"},{"level":2,"text":"下注规模：从信号到权重","id":"下注规模-从信号到权重"},{"level":2,"text":"协同：核心-卫星与归因闭环","id":"协同-核心-卫星与归因闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"收缩估计与稳健协方差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/shrinkage-and-robust-covariance"},"next":{"title":"凯利准则与仓位规模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing/kelly-criterion-and-sizing"}}